WEBVTT

NOTE Lyrics by Ash Stu. Timed with Demucs vocal separation + MMS forced alignment.

1
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:19.723
After many weeks, and many prayers

2
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.404
A cloud could be, there, in the air

3
00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:34.233
Parading through the peaks of mountains

4
00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.956
Fingers point toward the horizon

5
00:00:44.783 --> 00:00:47.806
"Joy! oh, joy! Hip-hip-hooray!

6
00:00:47.806 --> 00:00:51.430
We knew that God could hear us pray!

7
00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.673
There is a rain cloud in the sky!

8
00:00:54.673 --> 00:01:00.217
It's been so many moons since the sand went dry!

9
00:01:11.569 --> 00:01:15.192
Still tumbleweeds, still grains of sand

10
00:01:15.192 --> 00:01:17.460
A fox and mouse are holding hands

11
00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.582
The thirsty camels tap their feet

12
00:01:21.939 --> 00:01:25.242
Disco dancing in the heat

13
00:01:25.242 --> 00:01:28.605
"We all can see it! We all believe!

14
00:01:28.605 --> 00:01:30.980
We all must stay here! We must not leave!

15
00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.323
All gather close! Here comes the prophet!

16
00:01:35.372 --> 00:01:39.235
A cloud will bring the desert water!

17
00:01:42.979 --> 00:01:46.082
They learned too late, there was no cloud

18
00:01:46.282 --> 00:01:49.325
It looked so sure, they sang so loud

19
00:01:49.586 --> 00:01:52.749
But in the end, they had to find that

20
00:01:52.749 --> 00:01:56.452
Something else was in the sky
